{"name":"Chocolate Lust","hex":"#993322","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"chocolate","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A food made from ground roasted cocoa beans.","A drink made by dissolving this food in boiling milk or water."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Made of or containing chocolate.","Having a dark reddish-brown colour/color."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/chocolate"},{"term":"lust","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A feeling of strong desire, especially such a feeling driven by sexual arousal.","A general want or longing, not necessarily sexual."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To look at or watch with a strong desire, especially of a sexual nature.","To desire."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/lust"}],"entries":[{"title":"Chocolate","blocks":[{"text":"Chocolate is a food made from roasted and ground cocoa beans. It can be a liquid, solid, or paste. It is eaten on its own and used to flavor other foods."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/11/Three_Bars_%281%29.jpg/330px-Three_Bars_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chocolate","wikidata":"Q195"},{"title":"Lust","blocks":[{"text":"Lust is an intense desire for something. Lust can take any form such as the lust for sexual activity, money, or power; but it can also take such mundane forms as the lust for food or the lust for redolence. Lust is similar to, but distinguished from, passion, in that properly ordered passion propels individuals to achieve benevolent goals whilst lust does not."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6f/Jheronimus_Bosch_Table_of_the_Mortal_Sins_%28Luxuria%29.jpg/330px-Jheronimus_Bosch_Table_of_the_Mortal_Sins_%28Luxuria%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lust","wikidata":"Q649